      "prompt_html": "<p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS Tests 1 to 17</strong></a></p><p><strong><u>Task 1:</u></strong> The take below gives information about the underground railway systems in six cities.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words.</p><p></p><p></p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-transform: capitalize;\">underground railway systems</h2><p></p><p></p><figure><table><thead><tr><th>City</th><th>Date opened</th><th>Kilometers of route</th><th>Passengers per year (in millions)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>London</td><td>1863</td><td>394</td><td>775</td></tr><tr><td>Paris</td><td>1900</td><td>199</td><td>1191</td></tr><tr><td>Tokyo</td><td>1927</td><td>155</td><td>1927</td></tr><tr><td>Washington DC</td><td>1976</td><td>126</td><td>144</td></tr><tr><td>Kyoto</td><td>1981</td><td>11</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td>Los Angeles</td><td>2001</td><td>28</td><td>50</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br/><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins><br/></p><p></p><p></p>",
